(1090, 84, 3277, 946, 3149, 946, 1407, 1407, 128, 128, 0, 0, 3000, 3000, 16, 16, 16, 16, 1097, 0.0, 0.0, 5, 5, 'Kirin Tor', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 16712190, 'The mages and archmages running the city of Dalaran.  Faced with the rising threats of the Blue Dragonflight and the Scourge, they\'ve transported their city to the heart of Northrend.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 16712190)
